stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending : Checkout created (price > 0)
  [*] --> paid : Free item (0 VND) fulfilled immediately
  pending --> paid : Webhook / sync PAID, amount matches
  pending --> failed : payOS link creation failed
  pending --> cancelled : Buyer cancels on payOS
  pending --> expired : TTL passed (cron / sync)
  expired --> paid : Late payment confirmed
  paid --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
